<title>UK: T&amp;N director Sabberwal to step down.</title>
<headline>T&amp;N director Sabberwal to step down.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Automotive engineering group T&amp;N Plc said on Friday that executive director Amar Sabberwal would retire from the board at the end of the year.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said that Sabberwal, 63, had remained on the board for one year beyond normal retirement age and would continue to provide consultancy services to the group for the next two years.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
